        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/Maclab_Tulua/performances/MAC25JS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Tulua - Maclab Performance Series"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>TULUA are a young traditional Irish band hailing from the southeast of Ireland. Meaning 'tribe of many paths' TULUA have been deeply exploring and sharing music of their local area and other parts of Ireland, bringing the audience with them on a captivating journey of songs about love, tunes about life and everything in between. Their rooted passion for playing music has evolved together from a young age, and they now wholeheartedly explore the possibilities with their music and songs to create a sound unique to them, having been previously described as showing 'true bond and empathy' (IMM 2024) and 'music that transcends the mind' (NCFF 2025).</p>\n\n<p>Since their official formation in 2019, they have released their debut album (No Coming No Going 2023) and an EP (Rising 2021), and have successfully toured and performed in countries around the world (Ireland, Germany, Netherlands, Australia, France, USA, Canada).</p>\n\n<p><b><a href='https://tuluamusic.com' target='_blank'>tuluamusic.com</a></b></p>\n\n\n<p><b><big>Subscriptions on sale now: <a href='https://tpromaclab.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/Maclab_2526' target='_blank'>CLICK HERE TO PURCHASE</a></big></b></p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>"
      }
