    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Munro & Patrick"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p><b>Subscriptions on sale July 1: <a href=' https://okpas.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1694091714' target='_blank'>click here to buy!</a> - Invdividual shows on sale September 1, 2026.</b></p><p>Saskatchewan's most celebrated musical duo, Heidi Munro and Scott Patrick, bring their electrifying stage chemistry to the Fine Arts and Multimedia Centre for an intimate evening of original songs and soulful covers. With a vintage edge to their music and infectious, feel-good energy reminiscent of the early 70s, Munro & Patrick have captivated audiences across the country. Multiple SCMA award winners individually, together they've earned a reputation as Saskatchewan's power duo — delivering original songs filled with great hooks, gritty emotion, and honest storytelling. This is an evening of real, rootsy, beautifully crafted music from two artists at the top of their game. Don't miss the pair that's been called 'the dynamic duo of the prairies.' </p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n</style>"
      }
