        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1696980921/performances/HOR14KS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1696980921/performances/HOR14KS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "The 3 Impersonators: Diamond - Fortin - Dubé"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p><b>Three incredible performers. Over 100 iconic voices. More than 60 hits in 90 minutes!<br><br>\n\nMartin Dubé, Steeve Diamond, and Sylvie Fortin </b>bring the greatest hits of the last five decades to life in a fast-paced musical spectacle packed with unforgettable voices, electrifying performances, and plenty of surprises.<br><br>\n\nFrom Céline Dion to Tom Jones, Barbra Streisand to Axl Rose, Andrea Bocelli to Tina Turner, the trio moves effortlessly between the legendary voices of rock, pop, opera, and disco.<br><br>\n\nTogether, these internationally acclaimed performers have entertained audiences in more than 20 countries, from Las Vegas and Beverly Hills to Monaco and the Moulin Rouge in Paris.<br><br>\n\nGet ready for a musical journey through decades of hits, with spectacular vocal impressions, unexpected mashups, and the kind of energy that will have you singing along and dancing in your seat.<br><br>\n\n \n\n<b>Three performers. Hundreds of voices. One unforgettable show!</b></p>\n\n\n"
      }
    ],
