    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Horizon Players' Production of Mary Poppins Jr."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>Inspired by one of Disney's most beloved films and the\nacclaimed Broadway musical, Mary Poppins JR. brings\nthis timeless story to life for audiences of all ages. Set\nin England in 1910, the story follows the Banks family,\nwhose lives are transformed when the extraordinary Mary\nPoppins arrives. With magic, wisdom, and imagination, she\nteaches Jane, Michael, and their parents the importance\nof kindness, connection, and believing that 'anything\ncan happen if you let it.' Directed by Suzanne Merrills,\nMegan Sider, and Kirsten McOuat. Original Music and\nLyrics by Richard M. Sherman and Robert B. Sherman.\nBook by Julian Fellowes. New Songs and Additional\nMusic and Lyrics by George Stiles and Anthony\nDrewe. Co-Created by Cameron Mackintosh. Based\non the stories of P.L. Travers and the Walt Disney film.</p>\n<p><i>Performance materials are also supplied\nby <a href='https://www.mtishows.com/ target='_blank'>MTI.</a></i></p>\n\n<p><a href='https://horizonplayers.org/index.html' target='_blank'>horizonplayers.org</a></p>\n\n"
      }
    ],
