    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "SGCHS Theatre Arts presents Imaginary"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Milo is Sam's only friend and they spend all their time together, using only their imaginations to transform their world into a place of adventure and excitement. But as Sam's first day at a new school approaches, his mother worries that Milo is holding her son back, stopping him from growing up. School turns out to be full of surprises - and secrets. This show is an exciting, funny and inspiring musical about the wonder of childhood, the power of the imagination and what it means to grow up.</p>\n\n"
      }
    ],
