    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Cool Yule - Lions Gate Chorus & VanCity Harmony"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Have a Yule that's cool! Join Lions Gate Chorus and VanCity Harmony for a holiday celebration packed with music, laughter, and plenty of festive cheer. These dynamic choruses will be joined by special guests Metzin' Around, Van Q, and Lumina for a lively mix of seasonal favourites and popular hits, performed both a cappella and with a live band. Whether you're looking for classic holiday magic, fresh musical surprises, or simply a fun day out, Cool Yule has something for everyone. Put on your party best and get ready to raise a glass with us during an afternoon of festive sparkle, fabulous music, and holiday fun!\n\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>\n"
      }
    ],
