    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1694091708/performances/FMC16LS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Kenny & Dolly Christmas"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p><b>Subscriptions on sale July 1: <a href=' https://okpas.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1694091714' target='_blank'>click here to buy!</a> - Invdividual shows on sale September 1, 2026.</b></p><p>Kick off your holiday season in style with an unforgettable evening celebrating two of country music's greatest legends. Parton Productions brings Kenny Rogers and Dolly Parton back to life in a spectacular tribute show packed with the timeless duets and beloved solo hits that made them icons. From Islands in the Stream to The Greatest Gift of All, the chemistry between Kenny and Dolly has always been something special — a case of the whole being even greater than the sum of its parts. Expect big voices, dazzling costumes, warm seasonal spirit, and a full evening of country Christmas magic that the whole family will love. Grab your tickets early — this one always fills up fast.</p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
