    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Kick off your holiday weekend with an unforgettable evening of festive music featuring magnificent highlights from Handel's timeless masterpiece, Messiah.</p>\n\n<p>This is the perfect festive outing for the whole family.  Secure your seats today and let the countdown to Christmas begin!</p>\n\n"
