    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "From the Vancouver-based creative team behind the celebrated Canadian tours Music of the Night and A Whole New World comes an all-new holiday concert bursting with Christmas cheer!<br><br>\nFeaturing seven tree-mendous vocalists and a sleighin' five-piece band, this Holiday Spectacular brings together a high-energy celebration of timeless holiday songs, interactive sing-alongs, and festive fun.  <br><br>\n\nAnd don't forget to wear your CHRISTMAST UGLY SWEATER! (there will be prizes)<br><br>\n\nFor more information visit https://holidayspectacular.live<br><br>\n\nCreated and Brought to you by CREATIVE AF Productions.<br><br>\n\n15% off for groups of 10+<br><br>\n\n<iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/AelOt1ch47c?si=9SlcBvwMQyDnbdYY' title='YouTube video player' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>\n"
