      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "ANNIKA"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p><b>Subscriptions on sale July 1: <a href=' https://okpas.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1694091714' target='_blank'>click here to buy!</a> - Invdividual shows on sale September 1, 2026.</b></p><p>Calgary's own ANNIKA brings her remarkable blend of country songwriting and classical piano virtuosity to our stage for what promises to be one of the most captivating evenings of the season. A sought-after Canadian entertainer whose talent as a professionally trained pianist distinguishes her from many other vocalists, ANNIKA has earned multiple YYC Music Award nominations, charted on both CBC Country's Top 40 and Billboard Country's Top 50, and performed at iconic venues including Nashville's Bluebird Cafe and New York's Birdland Jazz Club. Inspired by artists such as Elton John and Alicia Keys, she combines her love of country songwriting with heartfelt piano playing and soulful vocals — and a refreshingly warm and comedic stage presence that wins over every room she plays. An Alberta artist doing us proud on the national and international stage</p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
