    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "The Elvis Concert featuring Pete Paquette - Presented by Paquette Productions"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>Don't miss Canada's one and only Pete Paquette as he delivers an unforgettable\nlive concert experience showcasing Elvis Presley's music: the 1950s, the 1968\nComeback Special in Leather, and the explosive Vegas years.</p>\n<p>A performance for all ages, this authentic and high-energy show will be backed\nby Pete's own band The Rockin' Royals, featuring a stellar cast of hand selected\nmusicians to give you the best sound and performance in live entertainment.\nAccompanying the Royals are the sensational Tonettes, singers who have been\nblessed with power, sensitivity, and vocal energy.</p>\n<p>The Elvis Concert is an exciting show celebrating the legacy of music's most\niconic figure, the King of Rock and Roll, Elvis Presley</p>\nGet ready to rock and roll!</p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: none!important;}\n</style>\n\n\n\n"
      }
    ],
