      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Arlo Maverick"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>4x WCMA nominee Arlo Maverick is a hip-hop artist who\naims to move people physically and emotionally. Arlo's\nmusic is relatable and timely, touching on everything\nfrom navigating trust issues in dating to finding your\npurpose and healing after the loss of a loved one.</p>\n<p>Although he incorporates genres like Afrobeat, jazz,\nand soul, hip-hop is always at the core. One of Alberta's\nmost recognized artists, Arlo's resume includes airplay in\nmultiple countries, appearances in various publications,\nheadlining festivals, touring overseas and charting on\nnational campus radio charts.</p>\n<p>Arlo's live show, which is backed by a live band, can be\ndescribed as a symbiotic exchange where the audience\nis part of the show. Creating moments unique to every\nperformance, no two Arlo Maverick shows are the same. </p>\n\n<p><a href='https://arlomaverick.ca/' target='_blank'>arlomaverick.ca</a></p>\n\n"
      }
    ],
