        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/genid/c0bffdece438dc0e"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1694091710/performances/FMC10CS27"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1694091710/performances/FMC10CS27"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Moon Dance: A Van Morrison Tribute"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p><b>Subscriptions on sale July 1: <a href=' https://okpas.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1694091714' target='_blank'>click here to buy!</a> - Invdividual shows on sale September 1, 2026.</b></p><p>Get ready for a night of pure soul, Celtic mysticism, and timeless rock as Moondance delivers the ultimate Van Morrison concert experience. This incredible show captures the Van Morrison concert experience like no other — you'll hear classic tunes including Brown Eyed Girl, Moondance, Domino, It Stoned Me, Tupelo Honey, Wild Night, Into the Mystic, Caravan, and more. As the Dallas News put it, 'If Van Morrison isn't coming to your town, Moondance is the next best thing' — with the LA Times calling it 'an incredible recreation of the Irish legend.' Whether you've followed Van the Man for decades or simply love great live music with depth and groove, this is a show packed wall-to-wall with hits you know and love. </p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
