    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprowest.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1706779755/performances/MCD10CS27"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Antonio Vivaldi - The Four Seasons - & Other Masterpieces of Italian Music"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>The music of Antonio Vivaldi has captivated audiences for more than three centuries with its extraordinary beauty, emotional depth, and timeless brilliance. Antonio Vivaldi - The Four Seasons and Other Masterpieces of Italian Music invites you on an unforgettable journey into the heart of the Italian Baroque, where some of the greatest works ever written come to life in an inspiring live performance.</p>\n<p>Performed by acclaimed violin soloist Miroslav Ambroš together with an outstanding string quartet, this concert promises an unforgettable evening of virtuosity, elegance, and expressive musical storytelling. The program features Vivaldi's iconic The Four Seasons alongside a selection of his finest compositions, offering an immersive musical experience filled with dazzling melodies, vibrant rhythms, and the timeless spirit of Italian classical music.</p>\n<p>In recent years, Miroslav Ambroš has celebrated a number of remarkable achievements on the international stage:\n<ul>\n<li><b>Gold Medal</b> - Vienna International Music Competition 2020</li>\n<li><b>Silver Medal</b> - Manhattan International Music Competition 2020</li>\n<li><b>Gold Medal</b> - Manhattan International Music Competition 2022</li>\n<li><b>Grand Prize (Absolute Winner)</b> - New York Classical Music Competition 2024</li>\n<li><b>1st Prize and Honorary Award</b> by Her Highness Archduchess Herta Margarete of Austria at the Mozart International Competition Vienna 2025</li>\n<li><b>1st Prize</b> - Schubert International Music Competition 2025</li>\n<li><b>1st Prize</b> - American International Music Competition 2025</li></p>\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n</style> \n"
      }
    ],
