    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Hannah Montana Tribute - Spruce's Sunday Series"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>Get ready to relive the magic of the ultimate Disney Channel era with <b>Hannah Montana Tribute</b>!\nFeaturing live vocals, a live band and live dancers, this high-energy tribute brings the songs, looks and iconic moments of Hannah Montana to the stage. From <i>The Best of Both Worlds</i> to <i>Nobody's Perfect</i>, get ready to sing, dance and feel like it's 2007 all over again. Come dressed as your favourite Hannah era and join the fun!</p>\n<p>Experience <b>Hannah Montana Tribute</b> at the Black Box Theatre as part of <b>Spruce's Sunday Series</b>.\n\n\n</p>\n\n"
      }
    ],
