        "@value": "<p>Presented by Royal Canadian Theatre Company</p>\n\n<p>Written by Patricia Johnson-Brooke</p>\n\n<p>How hard do you need to work to fulfill your dreams?</p>\n\n<p>This brand new youth theatre production is written by New Westminster local, Patricia Johnson-Brooke. in 2025, we produced 'We Don't Talk About Book Club' and are excited for this next adventure together!</p>\n\n<p>Join the princess on her pirate adventure across the seven seas, followed by her band of pirates and a sarcastic unicorn. </p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>\n"
      }
    ],
