      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "The Heels"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>The Heels are a dynamic Canadian trio now based\nbetween Nashville and Canada's west coast, making\nwaves in country music with their high-energy\nperformances, three-part harmonies, and bold\npersonality. Crowned Country Group of the Year at\nthe Josie Music Awards, their single 'Hush Money'\nreached #1 in France. They also earned Group of the Year,\nMusic Video of the Year, and Emerging Artist of the Year\nhonours at the BCCMA Awards.</p>\n<p>Their album I Am went viral on TikTok, topping iTunes\ncountry charts in more than ten countries, while their\nsingle 'Take the Trailer' receives national airplay across\nNorth America on iHeartRadio. Since moving to Nashville\nin 2024, they have performed more than 20 live shows\nmonthly, selling out venues including The Bluebird Cafe\nand The Listening Room. </p>\n\n<p><a href='https://www.theheelsmusic.com/' target='_blank'>theheelsmusic.com</a></p>\n\n"
      }
    ],
