    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Leduc Drama Society - Maclab Wednesday Series"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>The Leduc Drama Society's mission is to present quality theatrical productions to enrich, educate, and entertain our volunteers membership, Leduc, and surrounding communities. </p>\n\n<p>The Leduc Drama Society was founded in 1980 as a not-for-profit, year-round, amateur dramatics group which stages an energetic and diverse entertainment programme for its audiences. The Society strives to provide a supportive environment where everyone is welcome, regardless of skill level, ability, or background. Volunteers are essential to the success of the Society. </p>\n\n<p>The Society encourages cultural and artistic growth, fellowship, and excellence of its members while fostering an enthusiastic, respected, and hard-working corps of individuals who serve as volunteers and Board members.</p>\n\n<p><a href='http://www.leducdramasociety.ca/' target='_blank'>leducdramasociety.ca</a></p>\n\n<p><b><big>Series Subscriptions on sale now: <a href='https://tpromaclab.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/Maclab_WS2627' target='_blank'>Click here to purchase! </a></big></b></p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
