    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Lewis & Royal"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>Lewis & Royal are an Alberta-based comedy folk duo\nwhose infectious blend of humour, harmony, and roots\nmusic has entertained audiences across the Prairies for\ndecades. They first performed together in the bluegrass\ngroup The Rosebud Rivervalley Boys, where their creative\npartnership led to the smash-hit musical Chickens, now\nconsidered a prairie classic.</p>\n<p>Building on that success, they released their debut album\nAmpersand and began touring widely across Western\nCanada. Known for their easy banter, quick wit, and\nplayful stage presence, Lewis & Royal create performances\nthat are spontaneous, heartfelt, and full of laughter.</p>\n<p>Their live album Lock Up Your Gopher captures that\ntrademark energy. From intimate community halls and\nprairie churches to major folk festivals and the Calgary\nSaddledome, the duo continues to captivate audiences\nwith storytelling, rich harmonies, and comedic flair.</p>\n\n<p><a href='https://www.lewisandroyal.com/' target='_blank'>lewisandroyal.com</a></p>\n\n"
      }
    ],
