    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Horizon Players' Production of The Cemetery Club"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n<p>The Cemetery Club is a lovely story about a friendship\nbetween three women, each a character in her own way,\nbut loyal to their friends beyond a doubt. They look after\none other, even when a fella steps into the picture, and\nsomething changes. Our story has some drama, some\ntears, and definitely some laughter. You'll be thinking of\nyour own special relationships as you share some time\nwith our trio of delightful ladies.</p>\n<p>Written by Ivan Menchell<br>\nDirected by Kimberly Lang</p>\n<p>THE CEMETERY CLUB is presented by arrangement with\nConcord Theatricals on behalf of Samuel French, Inc. <a href='https://www.concordtheatricals.com/ target='_blank'>www.concordtheatricals.com</a></b></p>\n\n<p><a href='https://horizonplayers.org/index.html' target='_blank'>horizonplayers.org</a></p>\n\n<style>\ndiv.location-page-temp1696980936 > span:first-child  {\n  visibility: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n/* 2. Inject and display the new text */\ndiv.location-page-temp1696980936 > span:first-child:after {\n  content: 'Apr. 29 - 30 & May 1, 2027';\n  visibility: visible;\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n"
      }
