    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Brian Patafie's FUNNY AS PUCK Tour"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "On Thursday June 17<sup>th</sup> 2027 former NHL Calgary Flames Athletic Trainer turned Standup Comedian Brian Patafie will be coming to The Cugnet Centre here in Weyburn and he will be bringing his 'FUNNY AS PUCK' Cross Canada eh Show create ninety minutes of laughter in The Opportunity City. Brian has chosen a cast of some of North America's funniest standup comedians to join him on his Canadian Tour and for this show only his sponsors are offering SPECIAL $15.00 EARLY BIRD TICKETS in the risers and $25.00 floor seat tickets RIGHT UP TO June 12<sup>th</sup>!<br><br>\nIn May of 2021 Brian (affectionately referred to as Comedy's Original Enter-Trainer) started performing in front of appreciative comedy fans all over North America and the United Kingdom and he guarantees his 2027 show will again keep the audience laughing from start to finish. Come and listen to Brian share his adventures from his dysfunctional upbringing in a military home, his life of becoming a new father well into his forties and some hockey stories he has blended into an outrageous standup comedy routine. WELL, here is your opportunity to enjoy an evening with one of the most charismatic and entertaining figures from the world of professional sports as he shares his interesting and somewhat broken and flawed life stories in a humorous fashion on stage.\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n</style>\n"
      }
