    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>On Saturday July 17th 2027 former NHL Calgary Flames Athletic Trainer turned Standup Comedian Brian Patafie will be bringing his 'FUNNY AS PUCK Cross Canada Tour eh' to The Regier Theatre here in Courtenay. After opening his tour in Charlottetown PEI in April he will be doing show number thirty two at the iconic Harmston Avenue  Venue. Brian has chosen a cast of some of North America's funniest standup comedians to join him on his Canadian Tour and this show will highlight three Headliners during a 90 minute set that will create sustained laughter from start to finish.<br><br>\nIn May of 2021 Brian (affectionately referred to as Comedy's Original Enter-Trainer) started performing in front of appreciative comedy fans all over North America and the United Kingdom and he guarantees his 2027 show will cause you to laugh your ICE OFF! Come and listen to Brian share his adventures from his dysfunctional upbringing in a military home, his life of becoming a new father well into his forties and some hockey stories he has blended into an outrageous standup comedy routine. WELL Courtenay, here is your opportunity to enjoy an evening with one of the most charismatic and entertaining figures from the world of professional sports as he shares his interesting and somewhat broken and flawed life stories in a humorous fashion on stage</p>\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n</style>\n"
